  "description": "Newlywed 'Yeon', who secretly imagined her husband into the male lead of romance novels, and newlywed 'I-cheon', who suffered from a secret (!) medical condition he could never tell anyone. To keep each other's secrets and to achieve true marital love, the two begin their own secret role-playing (?) newlywed life! A uniquely colorful Joseon-era newlywed diary unlike anything seen before!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/70601328), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%95%BC%EC%84%A4%EB%B6%80%EB%B6%80/4963)",
